In which case, you still have to be very careful.  The general
rule would be to not go much lower than your experience level,
in this case level 6.  One level lower, especially if you're a
fighter, isn't necessarily a disaster, but you don't want to go
much deeper.

My recommendation, given your current level, would be to let
your pets do most of the killing for the moment, only
intervening if the encounter a monster with a wielded weapon.
Check often as to what they are (;, then position the cursor on
the pet), and as soon as they are cats, go into the mines.  It's
usually a good source of better armor, and two cats should
ensure that it doesn't get too rough for you.

